# asap7.layermap - map layer GDS <-> Virtuoso cho strmin / strmout
#
# BAN DU PHONG.  PDK asap7_pdk_r1p7 da co san ban CHINH THUC, uu tien dung:
#   $PDK_DIR/cdslib/asap7_TechLib_10/asap7_fromAPR.layermap  <- cho GDS do
#                                       Innovus/APR xuat (top_soc.gds)
#   $PDK_DIR/cdslib/asap7_TechLib_10/asap7_TechLib.layermap  <- cho GDS cua PDK
# Chi dung file nay khi chua cai PDK, hoac de tra cuu nhanh so layer.
#
# Nguon: bang 'layer <ten> <so>' trong asap7sc7p5t_28/rul/calibreDRC.rul (36 layer).
# Datatype 251 cho pin khop voi outputs/top_soc_gds.map do soc_write_gds_map sinh ra.
#
# <layerName> <purpose> <gdsNumber> <gdsDataType>

